---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import '../styles/index.css'

import {cards} from '../../content/cards.js'
import {cardName} from '../../i18n.js'
import CardPair from '../components/card-pair.js'
---

<Layout title="卡牌图鉴 · 爬塔">
	<article class="Container">
		<p><a class="Button" href="./index.html">&larr; 返回</a></p>

		<header class="Header">
			<h1 medium>爬塔</h1>
			<h2>{cards.length} 张卡牌</h2>
		</header>

		<div class="Box Box--text">
			<p>左边是卡牌本来的样子，右边是升级之后的样子。</p>
			<p>
				想自己做一张牌，或者调整现有的？本作是开源项目（AGPL-3.0），随便改。
				源码的获取方式见<a href="./manual.html">手册</a>页的授权说明。
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="Box Box--text Box--full">
			<div class="Cards Cards--grid Cards--withUpgrades">
				{cards
					.slice()
					.sort((a, b) => cardName(a).localeCompare(cardName(b), 'zh-Hans-CN'))
					.map((card) => <CardPair card={card} gameState={{}} client:load />)}
			</div>
		</div>
	</article>
</Layout>
